// { at, cron } to it (with ONCHAIN_SCAN_TOKEN as a bearer when set) and keeps its JSON answer, expected to be
// { scanned, opportunities, fills: [{ transactionHash, mechanism, netAtomic, asset }] }. Unset, it records that
